                  "name": "1  A record that wants a",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1  A record that wants a human answer is an Ask, never a work item.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "htO3U",
                  "name": "2  No deliverable, no ga",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "2  No deliverable, no gate: a work item at Review carries a branch, PR or check reference.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.4,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y6wrpA",
                  "name": "3  Every card is bound t",
                  "fill": "$fg-2",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "3  Every card is bound to its source key; when the source resolves, it closes under Handled for you, with the reason.",
